t)*M^2)/(6*C3*H^2))*(H^2*(c31*c32 + c33*c34)*C3^2 - M^2*(c31*c32 - \
c33*c34))/(2*H*C3*M), yZ9(z, t) = -((H^2*(c31*c32 + c33*c34)*C3^2 + \
